---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About TeBlocks"
	description="Learn about TeBlocks, the open source competitive tetromino stacking game."
	pubDate={new Date('September 2024')}
>
	<p>
		<strong>TeBlocks</strong> is a modern, fast-paced, and cross-platform tetromino stacking game built with Lua and LÖVE 11.5, forked and evolved from <a href="https://github.com/26f-studio/Techmino" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Techmino</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>Key Features</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Server-Authoritative Simulation:</strong> Real-time 60Hz deterministic physics with rollback netcode for seamless competitive 1v1 play.</li>
		<li><strong>Competitive Ranked System:</strong> ELO ratings, placement tiers, and global leaderboards to track your progress against the best players worldwide.</li>
		<li><strong>Single-player Modes:</strong> Sprint 40L, Sprint 100L, Marathon, Ultra, Master, and custom practice modes.</li>
		<li><strong>Replay System:</strong> Full deterministic replay recording and verification to study match highlights and analyze strategies.</li>
		<li><strong>Customization:</strong> Community skins, customizable handling (DAS, ARR, SDF), and custom keymaps.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Open Source & Community</h2>
	<p>
		TeBlocks is community-driven and open source under the LGPLv3 license. We believe in fair, cheat-free competition, accessible gameplay, and continuous improvement. Check out our source code on <a href="https://github.com/ItzMeNeon/teblocks" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>.
	</p>
</Layout>
